                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Varied experiences, those who enjoy games made with the retro 8 bit aethetics and classic game experience will get a few good hours out of this one\n\nFew small things that ruined the experience for me personally\n\n- hard locked myself out of the ending of 1 of the games somehow\n- individual exe files for each title make it so setting the audio a repeated task when swapping games\n- old school z + x control scheme on mnk left a bit to be desired, you can port old style games to modern control conventions after all\n\nOtherwise you can tell the dev team poured alot of time into capturing the premise they wanted to follow and it shows, buy on sale",
